sense of the season (end of the year atmosphere).\n・It doesn't matter whether the mask is worn or not, but we would like the elements to be included somewhere.\nIf you write the face under the mask, please use blue for the eyes.\n\nUsage\nUse in YouTube thumbnails or in distribution/videos\nUse in various SNS such as Twitter tweets, etc.\nUse in other VTuber activities in general\n\n■Data contents\nWe would be very happy to receive PSD files, but we will leave it up to Comerow.\nIf you have text, background, etc., it would be very helpful if you could separate them.\n\nIf there are no problems with your request, we would appreciate it if you could accept it.\nIf the amount of money is not enough, or if you do not accept the requested illustration in the first place, please cancel the request!\nThank you very much in advance!\n\nBelow are the URLs of the character's materials.\nPlease check the reference image here!\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CIGdZlqzpUOSynzE21vmH-3uprR0oSaR?usp=drive_link\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CIGdZlqzpUOSynzE21vmH-3uprR0oSaR?usp=drive_link", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@riceno32/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2591344, "client_id": 2850616, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fff51af9/uploads/origins/0349a546-e958-4fc4-8595-921de104b2f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8f6cafa94cffde5b44a742531ec8edf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fff51af9/uploads/origins/0349a546-e958-4fc4-8595-921de104b2f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8f6cafa94cffde5b44a742531ec8edf, https://si.imgix.net/fff51af9/uploads/origins/0349a546-e958-4fc4-8595-921de104b2f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7cb905d94c608e3dbeddc3d00c21